{"notebook":"nb1","page":17,"seed":17,"says":"The notepad leaves the desk for one page, because the letter did. A pillar box under a street lamp on a wet night: the box drawn first while the point is fine, then the street laid over the rest, hard, and here I do your chain honestly, worn flat, sharpened, worn flat again, because a wall at night is big and dull and deserves no better. You are right that the tabby went into a hole. I mind less than you do; that is what cats do after dark. Three pages, you say. I think two and a sentence.","before":{"length":103.55176258039906,"worn":0.026234191590962613,"eraser":9.09255869294569,"sharpenings":25,"graphite":21.08310340875391,"distance":494462.6820555244},"after":{"length":96.18524291266799,"worn":0.0268090445843167,"eraser":9.065284990266916,"sharpenings":27,"graphite":23.763347384441765,"distance":551631.8414529306},"stats":{"strokeM":57.16915939739997,"graphite":2.6802439756873055,"used":7.366519667731069,"sharpenings":2,"erasedMm2":246,"coverage":0.12288838569093226,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"curve","points":[[51,70],[51,66],[58,60],[72,57],[86,60],[93,66],[93,70]],"pressure":1},{"op":"polyline","points":[[51,70],[54,72],[54,134],[52,134],[52,140],[92,140],[92,134],[90,134],[90,72],[93,70]],"pressure":1},{"op":"curve","points":[[51,70],[62,73],[72,73.6],[82,73],[93,70]],"pressure":0.9},{"op":"curve","points":[[54,78],[64,80.4],[72,80.8],[80,80.4],[90,78]],"pressure":0.7},{"op":"curve","points":[[54,134],[64,136],[72,136.4],[80,136],[90,134]],"pressure":0.8},{"op":"hatch","region":{"rect":[61,88,22,3.6]},"angle":0,"spacing":0.25,"pressure":1.5},{"op":"curve","points":[[58.5,88.5],[60,85],[72,84],[84,85],[85.5,88.5]],"pressure":1,"repeat":2},{"op":"rect","x":63,"y":98,"w":18,"h":14,"pressure":0.8},{"op":"line","x1":65,"y1":101.5,"x2":79,"y2":101.5,"pressure":0.35},{"op":"line","x1":65,"y1":104.5,"x2":79,"y2":104.5,"pressure":0.35},{"op":"line","x1":65,"y1":107.5,"x2":79,"y2":107.5,"pressure":0.35},{"o